<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMBASSADOR APARTMENTS CUT.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMBASSADOR APARTMENTS CUT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said Monday Ambassador Apartments Inc was cut to hold from buy.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
